  "question": {
    "text": "The potential (in volts) of a charge distribution is given by<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> for <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> .<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> does not depend on x and y. If this potential is generated by a constant charge per unit volume <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> (in units of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#1013;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> ) which is spread over a certain region, then choose the correct statement.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
