      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "xFJSc",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϵ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> for <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> else where",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ztsHp",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϵ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>  for  <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>  and  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>  else where",
