      "id": "P5J9e",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ρ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ϵ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>  in the entire region",
